will cover the return shipping.', 'Privacy Policy\n\nWe value your privacy. Your personal information, such as your name, address, and payment details, is securely stored and never sold to third parties. We use your data only to process your orders and improve your shopping experience. Cookies may be used to personalize content and track preferences. You can opt out of cookies at any time through your browser settings. For any privacy-related concerns, please contact: privacy@trendify.com', 'The selected hotel and dates will pass directly to Hyatt.com. 10. Select the desired Room Type from the available options:\n\nHyatt Colleague Hyatt Colleague\nComp Discount\n\nfrom from\n\nso $120\n\nHide Rate Rules ~\n\nDetails\nHYATT COLLEAGUE COMPLIMENTARY ROOM\n\nDeposit Policy\nCredit Card Guarantee Required\n\nCancellation Policy\n72hnours Prior To 11:59 Pm Local Time The Day Of Arrival To Checkin To Avoid One Night Fee\n\n1 King Bed $0\nRest easy in this 314-square-foot room with one king bed, Avg/Night (USD)\na sitting area with chaise lounge, a spacious work desk\n\nwith enhanced lighting, and Google Chromecast seer\nMore Details\n\n2 Queen Beds $0\nEnjoy your stay in this 314-square-foot room, with two\nqueen beds, a seating area, a spacious, dedicated work\n\ndesk with enhanced lighting, and Google Chromecast. setae\nMore Details\n\nAvg/Night (USD)\n\n11. Enter all required information to complete the booking. Terms & Conditions\n\nComplimentary Rate is not eligible for World of Hyatt credit\n\nA valid credit card is required to guarantee all reservations\n\nChanges and cancellations are made through Hyatt.com\n\nThe colleague must be the person checking into the hotel\n\nAll reservations must be made in the colleague’s name\n\nResort fees will not be charged on complimentary room reservations\nColleagues may be required to pay local taxes or fees incurred\n\n*For a complete list of Terms & Conditions, please review the Colleague Complimentary Rooms Policy\n\nConfiden