Refund Policy

We offer a 14-day refund window from the date of delivery. To qualify for a refund:
- Items must be unused, in original packaging. - Proof of purchase is required. - Shipping costs are non-refundable. To start a return or refund, email support@trendify.com with your order number. If the product is defective or damaged, we will cover the return shipping.
