ed lighting, and Google Chromecast seer\nMore Details\n\n2 Queen Beds $0\nEnjoy your stay in this 314-square-foot room, with two\nqueen beds, a seating area, a spacious, dedicated work\n\ndesk with enhanced lighting, and Google Chromecast. setae\nMore Details\n\nAvg/Night (USD)\n\n11. Enter all required information to complete the booking. Terms & Conditions\n\nComplimentary Rate is not eligible for World of Hyatt credit\n\nA valid credit card is required to guarantee all reservations\n\nChanges and cancellations are made through Hyatt.com\n\nThe colleague must be the person checking into the hotel\n\nAll reservations must be made in the colleague’s name\n\nResort fees will not be charged on complimentary room reservations\nColleagues may be required to pay local taxes or fees incurred\n\n*For a complete list of Terms & Conditions, please review the Colleague Complimentary Rooms Policy\n\nConfidential Proprietary Information Notice\nThe information contained herein is confidential and proprietary of Hyatt Corporation and its affiliated management and franchise companies and\nshould not be reproduced or distributed without their express authorization.', 'Welcome to Trendify Store! At Trendify, we believe shopping should be simple, exciting, and accessible to everyone. Since 2020, we’ve been dedicated to bringing you the latest in fashion, gadgets, and home goods. Our mission is to deliver high-quality products with exceptional customer service. With warehouses located in the US and Europe, we ensure fast and reliable shipping to our global customers. Thank you for being part of our growing community!']]}
